&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(204, 9, 47);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join A Growing Team, &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 9, 47);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.bayada.com/the-bayada-way.asp&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay for the Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Our York Skilled Nursing Office is interested in a LPN or RN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt; who&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt; has a passion for home care to join our Skilled Nursing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe our clients and their families deserve the highest quality care delivered with compassion, excellence, and reliability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is eligible for a sign-on bonus of $1200 with the commitment of 2 night shifts/week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 9, 47);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Nurses Choose our York BAYADA Office?:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We pride ourselves on providing an excellent onboarding and training experience from Day 1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;On your first day, you can expect to meet our Clinical Manager, Administrator, Scheduler and support staff.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;During your paid orientation, we cover virtual and hands-on training and enjoy providing lunch for you and our team!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We have officially been open for 2 years in York County and are continuing to grow throughout York and soon Adams County!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
